      "option": "从外面过去",
      "trigger": "任何时候"
    },
    {
      "id": "E8",
      "origin": "S4",
      "target": "S7",
      "option": "先还钥匙",
      "trigger": "暂时离开"
    },
    {
      "id": "E9",
      "origin": "S7",
      "target": "S2",
      "option": "回长阶",
      "trigger": "重新与余舟商量"
    },
    {
      "id": "E10",
      "origin": "S2",
      "target": "S5",
      "option": "走楼外",
      "trigger": "任何时候"
    }
  ],
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "scene": "S1",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "你若留下，我会替花叔保管钥匙。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "scene": "S2",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R2",
      "listeners": [
        "R1"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "我留下。你不在这儿的时候可以交给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "scene": "S2",
      "line_no": 2,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "那就托给你了。钥匙在你掌心，别落下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "scene": "S3",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R3",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "你听的还是“若留下便替我保管”，我可没说她已经交了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "scene": "S3",
      "line_no": 2,
      "speaker": "R2",
      "listeners": [
        "R3"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "她说她给我了？不，我刚听岔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "scene": "S4",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R2",
      "listeners": [
        "R1"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "我用你刚交给我的钥匙开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "scene": "S6",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "a",
      "quote": "你把钥匙保管得真稳。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "scene": "S6",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "b",
      "quote": "上楼了，我们一起望潮吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L9",
      "scene": "S7",
      "line_no": 1,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "",
      "quote": "刚才的话收回，钥匙我收回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "L10",
      "scene": "S2",
      "line_no": 2,
      "speaker": "R1",
      "listeners": [
        "R2"
      ],
      "variant": "b",
      "quote": "这回先不给你了。"
    }
  ],
